<strong>=Teachers Content/Events=</strong>
-You can now "Ask for Help" from your teachers during School free time. (Before Class, Lunch Break, After School.) Afterwards you can chat with them to learn more about them. Each Teacher has 3 Topics with 2 Variations.
-You can now "Chat" with Alister from the Main Office during School free time. (6 Topics)

<strong>=Other New Content/Events=</strong>
-You can now "Ride Around on Bike" at Northend, The Northend Playground, and the Park. (2 Events)
-New Trait: "Kitsune" (Supernatural, Unlocks Special Events and Fox Tail/Ears will always appear on PC.)
-New Dream: Forest Run (Requires Supernatural Toggle, Rare, Special Kitsune Variation.)
-New Exposure Event (Only occurs following above Dream currently. (2 Skill Checks, Exposure Variations)
-You can now Customize curtain Appearance Aspects of your family during Character Creation and the Cheats Menu. (Thanks Ron!)
-You can now edit Traits via the Cheats Menu. (Thanks Isamu!)
-Improved Clothing Shop Interface. (Thanks Mittens!)
-New Clothing: Fingerless Gloves (Thanks Dicey!)
-The City Park Restrooms "Three Boys Compare" Event now has 2 additional variations for it you are hard.
-You can now Toggle Quest Hints in the Settings. This makes Requirements/Triggers appear for all Quests in the Quest Journal. (Thanks Ron!) [Due to this, Quest Hints will no longer appear in Change Logs to avoid Spoilers. You can find hints in the Quest Journal.]
-Slight updates to how Traits appear in the Character Menu. (Thanks Isamu!)
-New Test Swimming Perk "Swimming Endurance Bonus" that increases your Endurance Ability Score. (Thanks Ron!)
-Certain Core Classmates now have new underwear to match their official art. (Thanks Onihere & Ron!)
-Lucas can now wear Tighty Whities. (Thanks Ron!)

